# Automatically enter this project's Nix development environment.
#
#   1. Install direnv        https://direnv.net
#   2. Install nix-direnv    https://github.com/nix-community/nix-direnv  (caching)
#   3. Run `direnv allow`    once, in this directory
#
# After that, every `cd` into this directory puts the whole toolchain on your
# PATH (compilers, language servers, linters, formatters and scanners), and
# every editor launched from here inherits it.

use flake

# Rebuild the environment whenever the flake changes.
watch_file flake.nix
watch_file flake.lock

# Project-local secrets and overrides, never committed.
dotenv_if_exists .env
